---
// src/components/sections/about/PhilosophyCraft.astro
import { aboutContent } from '../../../config/content';
---

<section
  class="bg-surface relative overflow-hidden pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-28"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[96rem] px-6 lg:px-12">
    <!-- Header Editorial -->
    <div class="reveal max-w-4xl">
      <span
        class="text-accent mb-4 block text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase sm:text-sm"
      >
        Filosofi & Craftsmanship
      </span>
      <h1
        class="font-heading text-primary text-4xl leading-[1.02] font-normal uppercase sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
      >
        Dedikasi Kualitas Bunga Impor & Lokal Pilihan
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-secondary/80 mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed font-light sm:text-lg lg:text-xl"
      >
        Di Aura Fleur, setiap kelopak memiliki cerita. Kami menggabungkan
        kekayaan flora lokal kualitas terbaik dengan bunga impor eksklusif dari
        Ekuador dan Belanda, dirangkai menggunakan teknik floristry Eropa
        kontemporer.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Gallery Grid Asimetris -->
    <div class="reveal mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-12">
      <div
        class="border-border aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden border shadow-lg md:col-span-8"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1561181286-d3fee7d55364?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt="Proses Pemilihan Bunga Fresh"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class="border-border hidden aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden border shadow-lg md:col-span-4 md:block"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508615070457-7baeba4003ab?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt="Detail Buket Floral Craftsmanship"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
